<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Initial Public Offerings - Oct 28.</title>
<headline>Philippine Initial Public Offerings - Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of initial public share offerings in the Philippines.</p>
<p>=============================================================</p>
<p>COMPANY	  SHRS	 PRICE     EXPECTED OPEN/  LEAD</p>
<p>		     (MLN)     (pesos)	LIST DATE</p>
<p>=============================================================</p>
<p>Digital	1,271	  3.00	Oct 30/	  PCI Capital/</p>
<p>						Nov 27	    Salomon</p>
<p>									 Brothers</p>
<p>(Digital Telecommunications Inc is a telecommunications firm)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Coplex Energy   265.5		  -- Year-end ---</p>
<p>(Oil exploration firm Coplex Energy Corp said the IPO proceeds would be used to acquire a stake in four local oil fields and a Columbian oil field. Details of the IPO have not</p>
<p>yet been released.</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Prophil	    75	   1.0			   Peregrine</p>
<p>								     Capital</p>
<p>(Prophil Development Corp has interests in mass housing</p>
<p>			and construction)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Uniden				    Early 1997	Rizal Commcl</p>
<p>								  Banking Corp</p>
<p>(Uniden Philippines Inc is a unit of Japanese</p>
<p>telecommunications equipment maker Uniden Corp)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Reynolds	 238					   All Asia</p>
<p>								   Capital</p>
<p>(Reynolds is an aluminum products manufacturer)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>PCI Leasing						     PCI Capital</p>
<p>&amp; Finance Inc  121.22     3.60-11.10</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Mabuhay Vinyl  223.187    2.38-3.18			BPI Capital</p>
<p>(Mabuhay Vinyl is a manufacturer of polyvinyl chloride resin)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Premiere	  180	 1.0			     Asian</p>
<p>Entertainment						   Alliance</p>
<p>(Premiere Entertainment is a movie producer)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-</p>
<p>Jaka Industries				 1Q 1997     Merril</p>
<p>								    Lynch/</p>
<p>								    PCI Capital</p>
<p>(Jaka Industries is a diversified firm engaged in property and mfg)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>Boulevard     500 million    1.0 peso		   Philippine</p>
<p>Properties							National</p>
<p>Bank</p>
<p>(Boulevard Properties Holdings Inc has interests in the Fort Bonifacio development project and in a proposed hotel in Vietnam)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>Smart Communications</p>
<p>(Smart Communications Inc, a cellular phone operator, has not given details of its planned IPO. It just said it plans to sell 15 to 20 percent of its existing share capital)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
